{"ID":"20240118151242-783kmlh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151242-783kmlh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151242-783kmlh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151242-tv2u57b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110638-04bse8l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110643-pkmh8y1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:195,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:195\u0026#125;","title":"110ruí蕤核","type":"doc","updated":"20240903102715"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151242-tv2u57b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151242-tv2u57b","updated":"20240122110620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘温，主心腹邪气，明目，目赤痛，伤泪出，久服轻身，益气不饥。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110622-36n0szh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110622-36n0szh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陝西河南等地，核仁入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110624-exwfoye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110624-exwfoye"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110628-tdloejz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110628-tdloejz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蕤核主心腹邪热结气，治目赤痛伤泪出，翳膜，眦烂，生用疗多睡，熟用治不眠。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110630-3ic4fun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110630-3ic4fun"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】破心下结痰痞气，齆鼻。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110631-8yhdq8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110631-8yhdq8m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治鼻衄。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110633-ys0xl4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110633-ys0xl4m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【吴普】强志，明耳目。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110635-visq6ar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110635-visq6ar"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】生治足睡，熟治不眠。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110636-x9q5cka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110636-x9q5cka"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110637-gy8m194","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110637-gy8m194"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】能补肝虚，今人多用治眼疾，然非火风暴眼所宜用也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122110638-x46m743","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110638-x46m743"}},{"ID":"20240122110643-w65ocmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110643-w65ocmb"}},{"ID":"20240122110643-pkmh8y1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110643-pkmh8y1","updated":"20240130102357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个110蕤核，这个用得不多，我们很少用它。这个药，生用治疗睡眠太多，熟用治疗失眠，“老师，这个是反的“，对，反的。可以使用，可以补肝，现在的人，多使用眼疾，眼科治疗上面。也是仁核用药，是那个仁入药，专门对失眠、睡眠、眼睛的问题使用的。药性是温的，温性的药，我们知道温性的药的话治疗热证要小心一点，任何东西熟用，炮制过，炮制过就是烘焙过，你如果说锅子里炒过，就是制过，炒过就可以了。这药我们用得不多。"}]},{"ID":"20240122110638-c4gc2n0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110638-c4gc2n0"}},{"ID":"20240122110638-04bse8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110638-04bse8l"}}]}